OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to boost use of upper floors
OL,4,Ain town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FProperty owners in Newark are being
OL,7,Fgiven support to find ways to develop
OL,8,Fthe upper floors of buildings in the
OL,9,Ftown centre.
OL,11,FAn upper floor conversion scheme aims
OL,12,Fto help landlords with risks associated
OL,13,Fwith bringing back upper floors of
OL,14,Fbuildings into use, with #800,000 of
OL,15,Ffunding available through the
OL,16,Fgovernment's Pride in Place programme.
OL,18,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,19,Fsaid Newark's vacancy rate was
OL,20,Fcurrently above the national average at
OL,21,Fabout 12%, a rise from the 9.54%
OL,22,Frecorded in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
