OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to boost use of upper floors
OL,4,Ain town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, officials have said there are
OL,7,F"green shoots of investment" in the
OL,8,Ftown, citing book retailer Waterstones
OL,9,Fmoving into a building and an art
OL,10,Fschool set to open in a former cafe.
